  "note": "Annual election of the Antrim Town Commissioners due on 15 May 1939. No nomination at all was lodged, so the following Commissioners were deemed re-elected (Belfast News-Letter, 10 May 1939, p. 3). No nomination was lodged; the nine sitting Commissioners were deemed re-elected. Returned unopposed."
